WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:01.800
One reusable template.

00:01.800 --> 00:05.990
Merge fields, a number series,
and what the employee must do.

00:06.500 --> 00:07.592
Generate in bulk.

00:07.592 --> 00:11.330
Pick the approval, the
signatory, and filter employees.

00:11.330 --> 00:12.728
Twenty four matched.

00:13.200 --> 00:16.295
Preview each letter with that
employee's real data merged in.

00:16.295 --> 00:17.783
Then send for approval.

00:19.400 --> 00:22.156
The signatory approves and
signs from their inbox.

00:22.156 --> 00:24.229
One click signs the whole batch.

00:25.600 --> 00:31.028
Release to the portal, by email as a
password-protected PDF, and require acknowledgement.

00:31.600 --> 00:33.910
Employees acknowledge in their documents.

00:33.910 --> 00:37.157
Signed, delivered, acknowledged, in minutes.
